Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.65,0:00:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在你来这儿之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before you came to the city,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.37,0:00:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我祈求诸神把我从主人手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I prayed to the gods that they would deliver me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,解救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from the hands of my Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神回应了我的祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in you my prayers were answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.43,0:00:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,想还债 就离我远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then see it repaid, by staying far from my presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,以及像我这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And men of my kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯从希留爱沙山释放了一些俘虏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus releases a clutch of prisoners from Sinuessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮助那个杀死你丈夫的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You gave aid to the man that robbed you of husband's life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就为了自保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in order to save your own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就算重来一次 我还是会这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing I would do again, if so needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲爱你 提比略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your father loves you, Tiberius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他夺走了我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, he took something from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.25,0:00:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也要夺走他的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would have something in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.71,0:00:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不希望你落到这个下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not wish you such an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们中计了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are betrayed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要打开城门 夺回这座城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must see gate opened and city retaken!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.47,0:00:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fucking traitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是该死的罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I'm fucking Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.19,0:01:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：诅咒者之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.27,0:01:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,《战利品》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说了 你们该逃跑了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did I not tell you that you should run?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.79,0:01:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须守住城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must hold the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are too many!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:01:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:01:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到希留爱沙城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Welcome to Sinuessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人是从哪儿涌进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where did fucking these appear from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,城门被攻下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gate has fallen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被出卖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have been betrayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是愚蠢 竟然信任赫拉克里奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand eternal fool for laying trust in Heracleo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Heracleo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,背叛我们的是莱西克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was Lyciscus that turned upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个该死的罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He stands fucking Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,狗日的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fucking shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他才会帮那些西利西亚人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is why he aided the Cilicians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.57,0:03:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也背叛我们了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have fucked us as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.10,0:03:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,纳西尔去哪儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is Nasir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.99,0:03:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,和卢戈一起去提醒大家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dispatched with Lugo to call warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,通知大家向北门撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carry word to break for northern gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须确保剩下的人安全撤到山上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must see all that remain to safety of the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我们逃跑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would have us run?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是想保全大家的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have us live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们必须战斗 守住这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we must fight and make our stand here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏现在占据上风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus has seized the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还不足以直接与他兵戎相见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are not prepared to face him in the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的人还没等撤出北门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor will our numbers pass through northern gate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他就能打过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before he descends upon them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我来引开他们 争取一点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will cause distraction, and gain needed time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By what means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没想好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no fucking idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不 和他们一起撤吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, move with the others,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.72,0:04:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我去把罗马人引开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will draw the Romans away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我这不是请求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is not request!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你是他们的领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You lead these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.11,0:04:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你死了 那将是致命的损失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you were to fall it would be fatal blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我死了 没多少人在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My passing of lesser concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我很在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of concern to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.56,0:04:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等我完事了就去找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will find you when it is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.63,0:04:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会尽量等你的 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall wait as long as we are able, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:04:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mad fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.19,0:05:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 千万不要死 - 你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Do not die. - Nor you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快跟他们一起走吧 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go with them, quickly. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.47,0:05:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我的死 比你更微不足道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My passing would be of even lesser concern than yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay close to heel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不希望今晚就挂掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not greet this night our last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.83,0:05:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you lost mind?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,卡斯特斯是来帮忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Castus came to aid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们这些家伙只帮该死的罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He and his people aid only the fucking Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not know of what you speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我酒醒了才发现兄弟们都走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I awoke from drink to find my brothers gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他没参与这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He had no hand in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agron...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:05:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,很多敌人过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.03,0:06:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是敢拿武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make attempt to seize weapon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我就要了你的狗命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'll have your fucking life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们往山上撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We move for the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这算什么计划啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not much of a plan, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你有更好的 就说出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you hold better one, break words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.97,0:06:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,操 不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jupiter fuck me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么还在城里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you yet within the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在逃跑的路上 罗马人就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was upon path to leave it when the Romans came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.39,0:06:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,别哭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold tears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.11,0:06:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,跟在我身边 千万别出声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay by my side, do not make a sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我们都会没命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or see us all to the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.93,0:06:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经放弃了希望 开始烧城了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They abandon hope and burn the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,叛贼们烧了粮仓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rebels have set torch to horreum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.31,0:07:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,已派出三支百人队去…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Three centuries have been dispatched to quell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,撤回来 按原计划前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Recall them and move towards commanded path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯打算将我们的胜利果实化为灰烬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus attempts to turn victory into ash{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.07,0:07:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你还要把军队撤回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you recall your men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我的计划已经开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have set plan to motion,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不能为此分心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and will not fall to distraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们朝北门进军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We advance on northern gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,列队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Form up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上 别停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep pace and do not pause!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quickly! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,多纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Donar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我就要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I am to die,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,生命的最后一刻能与你共度 真的很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it lifts heart to share final moment with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚很多人都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many have fallen this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shall not be among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.65,0:08:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep pace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.61,0:08:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:08:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,卡斯特斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Castus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:08:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你这该死的叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You traitorous fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他不知情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He knew nothing of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.94,0:09:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他自己的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By his own fucking tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不是吵架的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is not time to fall to quarrel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,绑住他的手 让他和大家一起出城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bind his hands and see him through the gate with the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,能打的留在后面掩护大家上山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those who can fight take rear position as you take to the ridge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,带他走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 不要回头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move quickly, and do not turn back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,护送他们出城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See all through the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,列队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须关闭城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must seal gate behind us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.39,0:10:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你要找的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man you seek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seize him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.26,0:10:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神居然会眷顾这群杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even the gods grant aid to the fucking man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他们早晚都要完蛋的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They but delay inevitable fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.60,0:10:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,闩上城门 派兵驻守在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring ram to bear. Sentries to guard sundered gateway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不追吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We do not follow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:11:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.33,0:11:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,全城搜查幸存的叛贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweep the city for any of his followers that yet hold breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.55,0:11:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要处决他们 以庆祝此番大捷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that we may rob them of it in celebration of glorious victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,去你妈的 你这罗马混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck your little bird, you Roman cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,搜仔细了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Search everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.65,0:11:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,全都找出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Search them all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.59,0:11:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,让士兵们吃饭休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give men rest and meal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,明天一早就上山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow's dawn shall see them march upon the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,随从营地怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of followers' camp,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还有斯巴达克斯放出来的罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the Romans freed by Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要让他们进城吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall they be moved within safety of city walls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,只允许士兵进城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only soldiers to be permitted within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.06,0:12:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,答不对口令的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any found absent proper watchword{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,格杀勿论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be executed upon sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不希望满街叛贼的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have streets swollen with bodies errant rebels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,给他们提供藏身之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet could secret themselves among.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不过少数人可以特殊对待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Though deserving few shall be granted consideration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,派人把这张单子上的人送到我宅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dispatch your men and see all upon this brought to villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你恢复原状了 恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, you return to form, Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这样子好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A most welcomed sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.40,0:12:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚还在赞赏他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was only just praising him for his ability{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,居然能毫不费力地混进野狗群\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to blend so effortlessly with a pack of savage dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,谁敢这样想呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing of ill consideration,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是克拉苏运筹帷幄的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}had Crassus not plucked scheme from fevered brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉我曾对此持怀疑态度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am of regret to have ever laid doubt upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,听到希留爱沙山解放的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Senate will be most pleased{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.43,0:12:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,元老院肯定倍感欣慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to greet news of Sinuessa en Valle's liberation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,先别急着回罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Linger before return to Rome,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起屠杀战俘以庆功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}see it celebrated with Carnificina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,处决战俘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Executions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.59,0:12:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,黄昏开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As night greets us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我腾出了最好的宅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've set aside one of the finest villas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,供你在庆功会之前休息沐浴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for you to rest and see yourself to bath, until such a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:13:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,出乎我意料 不过感谢款待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A gesture unexpected, yet much appreciated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧他趾高气昂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Preening little fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.80,0:13:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,同感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A sentiment shared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.37,0:13:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不过他代表了元老院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet he holds the ear of the Senate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.05,0:13:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我要好好款待他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I would see him well satisfied{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,让他回罗马后为我们的胜利美言几句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to further bolster tale of our victory carried back to Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,明眼人都能看出这算不上胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You speak again of victory shrouded from discerning eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.93,0:13:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus yet lives,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.35,0:13:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在米利亚峰的叛贼实力不容小觑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with considerable force aiding him upon Melia Ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.22,0:13:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们逃不出去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no escape from the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,无路可走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It stands impassable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这种话 傻瓜葛雷博就说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Words most likely broken by the fool Glaber{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,当时他把叛贼困在了维苏威火山上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when he had the rebel trapped upon Vesuvius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我是傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You believe me the fool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你有无穷的谋略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe you a man of infinite plots,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,戈尔迪之结 希腊神话中的一个难题\N其巧妙连戈尔迪之结也难媲美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}twisting upon themselves to shame Gordian knot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:13:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢称赞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praise well received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,别再想那些烦心事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now part mind from troubled thoughts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回归正题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and allow it returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.97,0:14:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,叛贼遭受致命打击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rebellion has suffered fatal blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我要开庆功会 褒奖有功之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At celebration I would honor hand that struck it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望色雷斯人的首级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that the Thracian's head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,插在长矛上 见证此等荣耀时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon pike bore witness to such laurels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.74,0:14:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,保持耐心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold fast to patience,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.61,0:14:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,耐心才使我们走到这一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a thing that has propelled us to the ground we now stand upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.47,0:14:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不用多久 就能除掉斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in briefest passing shall claim Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,以及追随他走向灭亡的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and all those who yet follow the doom of his shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们走了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They take leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,街上还有上千人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thousands more swell in streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有人提到了胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The ones above spoke of victory,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.67,0:15:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们死了很多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}great numbers lost to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,更多的是诅咒斯巴达克斯逃了出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Coupled with the curse that Spartacus yet eludes them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.35,0:15:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,想杀他可不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is a troublesome man to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经试过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have attempted it myself upon occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神眷顾他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods favor him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也会保佑我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And bless us as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神冲我们撒尿 你还当成雨露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They piss upon us and you welcome it as cooling rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们活下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,因为诸神在指引你的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because they yet guide your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.23,0:15:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你能带我们逃出生天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One I have faith will see us from darkest hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望我也这样想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that I shared the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前给人包扎过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have done this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.72,0:15:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我的主人经常打伤奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dominus inflicted many wounds upon his slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.27,0:15:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我常常帮他们疗伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I often tended their injuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那谁帮你疗伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who tended yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,迪欧特莫斯待我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Diotimus showed a kindness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.07,0:16:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did he now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他待我像哥哥一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He stood as a brother to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀死了夺走他生命的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You struck down the man that took his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那个多年以来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man that took my own,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.25,0:16:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢侵蚀我生命的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a small piece at a time over span of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿有所改变吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that it had made difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你改变了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have made all in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,给她松绑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See her hands freed of bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她不是奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This woman stands no fucking slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:16:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do I not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.20,0:17:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到的我是另一副样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have laid eyes upon distorted reflection of the man before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我潜伏在叛贼之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was secreted among the rebels,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,满脸胡子 满口谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}beard upon cheek and lies upon tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你站在克雷斯那帮禽兽一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stood with Crixus and his animals{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,任由他们屠杀已沦为奴隶的我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as they slaughtered my people, bound in chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我深表遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A deed of much regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.03,0:17:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但也只能如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet born of necessity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在说服西利西亚人反戈之前 我不能暴露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not risk discovery short of turning the Cilicians to our cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.95,0:17:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,战争中 一切都是为了生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In war, one does what one must to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,感同身受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A burden not unfamiliar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.56,0:17:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏有吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus would have word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,在你曾经的家中安排了一顿盛宴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are to be fed proper meal and bathed in rosewater,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还有玫瑰花浴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the villa you once called home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想吓你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not move to frighten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.03,0:18:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,最近的事情让我精神紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Recent events set nerves to edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再担忧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See grave concern give way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,城已攻占\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The city is taken,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我毫发无伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I stand unscathed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A great victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.57,0:18:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One whose celebration,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一起参加庆功大会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have you share in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以留在您这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am to stay here, with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.23,0:19:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你不高兴吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you stand pleased by it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,高兴得无以言表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beyond the telling of words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该高兴才对 怎么流泪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no cause for tears on such a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是高兴的泪水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are of joy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.89,0:19:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,为我终于能摆脱随从营地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to find myself delivered from followers' camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,摆脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Delivered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有这么不开心吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Has it grown so unpleasant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.79,0:19:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,难以忍受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unbearably so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fault is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.93,0:19:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,萨比努斯的死让我很悲伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I lay upon Kore heavy burden,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.80,0:19:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我对克芮倾诉太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of lending ear to my grief{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.83,0:19:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,给了她很大的精神负担\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the passing of Sabinus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是我造成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my hand in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,当命运召唤之时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man does what is required,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你尽到了责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when fate calls upon him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,军令如山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As all soldiers must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,克芮给我的安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kore served greater comfort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是您难以想象的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than you will ever know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就怕我的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I fear my pain has,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,给她造成了太大的压力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}pressed hard against her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.58,0:20:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿你足够坚强 不要垮掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray you are not too delicate to bear such weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我虽然不是战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand no soldier in this conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但该我做的我绝不逃避\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I too shall do what I must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,感激不尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am forever grateful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,去准备一下酒和食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See wine and food prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这场战争永远地改变了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This war has forever changed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.09,0:20:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,改变的不止是她一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She does not stand alone is such regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.80,0:20:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,也同样磨砺了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am but hardened by it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,使我教训深刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the lessons it has taught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来担心十一抽杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had thought decimation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.41,0:20:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能让你丧失理性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in threat of pulling you from reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可你如凤凰涅槃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you rise like the phoenix,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.11,0:20:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,眼中充满火焰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the fire of purpose filling eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不久你便能官复原职 代我行使权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And soon shall take your place again as my word and my will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:21:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,您还没有恢复我的职位吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You did not summon to reinstate me into the legion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我安排你负责主持屠杀战俘一事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have you present carnificina for the men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,当着军团的面提升士气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will elevate you in the eyes of the legion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.97,0:21:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你便能出出风头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be seen in such giving spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.10,0:21:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,为你重新掌握军权铺平道路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And ease the way for you to again assume command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,承蒙关照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A privilege then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是称颂您此次大捷的好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And opportunity to honor you and your triumph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.65,0:21:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mistake intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.35,0:21:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要宣扬的是恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall honor Caesar as the victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟他向来不和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no love lost between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 等我掌权 他很适合在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely there must be more fitting service that I might{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.17,0:21:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,聪明人懂得如何化敌为友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A shrewd man turns rival to valued ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.21,0:21:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒背负家族的传奇名号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar is blessed with storied name,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.25,0:21:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,终有一天他的成就堪与日月争辉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and shall one day rise to shame the very sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,与他交好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make peace,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候你自然受益无穷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and bask in glorious light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.56,0:21:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他会得到应有的尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He shall be awarded all respect deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.90,0:21:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,很多孩子投身战场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many a boy may enter a war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但到了最后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet at it's end,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.94,0:21:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,走出来的只有男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}only a man will emerge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你能成为这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It warms my heart to see you become one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是您造就了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am what you have made me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.43,0:22:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,来的人更多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More soldiers return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正在拆开木板到处搜索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They pry wood and beams searching for vermin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.81,0:22:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不走 他们能发现我们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we stay, will they not find us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.94,0:22:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.43,0:22:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就坐以待毙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there nothing we can do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.01,0:22:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有一件事可以做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is but one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.18,0:22:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.85,0:23:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果回来的人不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If any but my visage return,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.87,0:23:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你就自刎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}take your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.52,0:23:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,比起他们的手段 这是最好的结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will be a kindness in comparison to what they will do to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.12,0:23:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,叛贼 在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rebel! Here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.81,0:23:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,逮住他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始相信你说的神了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I begin to believe in your gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.34,0:24:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,看看他们能眷顾我们多久吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see how far they will take us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.70,0:24:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,白葡萄酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Falernian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.45,0:24:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这酒让我想起你的滋味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A taste I recall you favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.80,0:24:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这是给你父亲准备的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is for your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.78,0:24:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他拥有的太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As are many things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.92,0:24:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅有很多事情要考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Imperator has much pressing upon mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.03,0:24:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,给他增添烦恼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Laying more upon it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.91,0:24:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,无异于往胸口插刀子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would only serve to open grievous wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.19,0:24:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,多年来我对你的关心难道毫无意义吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do all the years I have cared for you stand for nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.01,0:24:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你给了我极大的抚慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have brought me greatest comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.94,0:24:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是离开我们家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would sadden heart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.50,0:24:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我该有多么伤心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to see you turned from our house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.73,0:24:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,又或者你受到最残酷的惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or set to cruelest punishment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.55,0:24:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,要是让他知道你为了安慰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he ever learned how you willingly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.31,0:24:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,主动献身的那股殷勤劲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}gave yourself to me in attempt to ease my pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.23,0:24:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,说错一个字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If errant word falls from mouth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.84,0:24:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就等着受苦吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}only suffering will follow them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.44,0:24:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,动手的不是统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At the hands of the Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.80,0:24:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.10,0:25:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,下次我就不会这么温柔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I will not be as gentle next time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.01,0:26:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你真美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand a vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.56,0:26:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,堪比我的爱妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One to rival my own beloved wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.66,0:26:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,恢复原来的样子 真像做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is as a dream, to be resurrected so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.83,0:26:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.47,0:27:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏等着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus awaits your company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.74,0:27:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,遵照您的指示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has been prepared,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.47,0:27:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.58,0:27:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,上次见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When last I laid eyes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.22,0:27:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你就像一尊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you appeared as defiled effigy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.56,0:27:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,因战祸而蒙尘的雕像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}marred by calamity of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.70,0:27:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,现在恢复了维纳斯般的美貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now restored to graven image of Venus herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.33,0:27:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.80,0:27:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,为您所做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For all that you have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.12,0:27:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有别的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would take my leave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.07,0:27:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我告退了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I am of no further use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.68,0:27:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在庆功宴前先回趟房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall to your chambers in advance of celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有份礼物等着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shall find welcomed gifts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.33,0:27:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你应得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}most deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.27,0:27:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要庆功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You hold celebration?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.62,0:27:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,屠杀战俘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carnificina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.38,0:27:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,庆祝我们战胜了叛贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In honor of our victory against the rebel king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.46,0:27:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.79,0:27:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕我还打不起精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear I am not yet of strength{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.27,0:27:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我没指望你会出席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not imagine you would be of attendance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.86,0:27:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你能活着就是万幸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a blessing you yet draw breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.43,0:28:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯手下留情 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One bestowed by Spartacus himself, was it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.73,0:28:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,正如我告诉您的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I have told you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.49,0:28:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我只为了解救我的人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I exchanged words with the man only in hope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.46,0:28:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,和他说过几句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of sparing what remained of my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.72,0:28:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为这没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Know that I find no fault in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.10,0:28:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,携雨之使者的传奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The whole of Rome echoes with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.42,0:28:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在整个罗马传得天花乱坠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}inflated legend of the Bringer of Rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.13,0:28:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望听听真实的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would hear air filled with truer tale,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.53,0:28:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,关于斯巴达克斯的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of Spartacus the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.48,0:28:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是他的俘虏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I knew him only as captor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.25,0:28:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是在套你话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not move to trap you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我渴望听到对这位罕见敌手的中肯评价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but crave honest appraisal of worthy adversary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.50,0:28:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很快要在战场上见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One I shall soon meet upon field of battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.44,0:28:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯似乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus seems...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.07,0:28:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不是人们想象中的野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not the beast, one would form thought of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.69,0:28:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没有尖牙利爪 那他有什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in place of horns and sharpened claw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.64,0:28:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一颗受伤的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A wounded heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.69,0:28:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,讨回公道的渴望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yearning to balance scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.68,0:29:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他妻子的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know of his wife,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.04,0:29:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也知道他渴望复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his thirst to avenge her death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.41,0:29:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他并非嗜血成性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No he is not consumed by a thirst for blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.76,0:29:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他曾经是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps he stood as such once,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.36,0:29:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.12,0:29:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他为自己的信念而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he fights for what he believes is just.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.58,0:29:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么比这更危险的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no cause more dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.69,0:29:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会停下脚步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will not stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.88,0:29:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他不会 即使他自己想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not believe he could, even if he so wished it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.88,0:29:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说他和我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then he and I stand the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.76,0:29:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,都觉得自己是英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Each believes himself the hero,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.47,0:29:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对方是恶人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the other villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.95,0:29:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,历史会证明谁对谁错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is for history to decide who is mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.68,0:29:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在此之前 我们都要在命运舞台上各饰其角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until such a day,we shall play our parts upon fortune's stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.43,0:29:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都要如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As each of us must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.18,0:29:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,城归您了 伟大的克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The city is yours, mighty Crassus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.13,0:30:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我来拿说好的奖赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see to agreed upon price{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.32,0:30:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,因为罗马收复失地有我的功劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for aiding in its return to Roman hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.38,0:30:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,您和这些混账做了交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You set bargain with this fucking shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.25,0:30:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,代价沉重啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One of gravest cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.54,0:30:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不要出现在我面前了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See yourself far from my presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.74,0:30:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,否则要你们看不到明天的太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or witness rise of morning sun from the shores of the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.99,0:30:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我今晚便如您所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will take most welcomed leave by night's end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.62,0:30:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,带着应得的奖励离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With all that I have been promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.11,0:30:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am a Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.27,0:30:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮了我们的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that gave aid to our enemy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.86,0:30:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是何原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for whatever the reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.87,0:30:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You cannot do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.66,0:30:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,事情已经定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is already done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.32,0:30:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,遵守诺言的人如今很少见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is the rarest of things, to see a man that honors his words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.62,0:30:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要是过了时间还不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay beyond agreed upon hour,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.32,0:31:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你就会看到我是怎么遵守诺言的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you shall know the bitter truth of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.04,0:31:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,愿诸神给予你应得的赏赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May the gods grant all that you deserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.98,0:31:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}mighty Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.36,0:31:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就像他们对待我赫拉克里奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As they have granted Heracleo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.81,0:31:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.89,0:31:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,城墙之外有数不尽的奇观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are many wonders beyond these walls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.33,0:31:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我盼着你能见识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I long for you to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.63,0:31:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你想谈谈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wish to break words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.82,0:31:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,提比略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tiberius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.51,0:31:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真令人欣慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It warms heart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.61,0:31:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你从最近的不幸中走出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to see you recovered from your recent misfortunes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.66,0:32:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,来 喝酒 让我们好好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, drink wine, let us regail{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.21,0:32:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没有时间陪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My time is of short offering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.22,0:32:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我忙着准备你的庆功会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am taken with preparing celebration in your honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.09,0:32:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的付出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude for the effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.92,0:32:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候你想来点什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there anything you desire towards it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.03,0:32:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂蜜酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Honeyed wine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.98,0:32:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,烤野猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roasted boar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.56,0:32:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,来自波塞冬花园的牡蛎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oysters plucked from Poseidon's garden?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.64,0:32:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想表达一下对你的敬意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would merely attempt to honor you with gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.26,0:32:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你对我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you honor me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.76,0:32:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是坎莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Canthara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.12,0:32:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,出生于尼罗河东岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Born east of the Nile,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.87,0:32:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不过别拿这个说她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but do not judge her for it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.73,0:32:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,随从不能进城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Followers are not allowed within city walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.03,0:32:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你父亲的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a gift from your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.88,0:32:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意和你分享\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One I would share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.85,0:32:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是他命令你这么做的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did he command you to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.82,0:32:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就像命令我称颂你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As he commanded me to pay tribute to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.42,0:32:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还是回到我身边吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Return to more willing flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.62,0:32:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子更喜欢辩论 而不是上床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The boy favors contention over cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.01,0:33:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but favor truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.41,0:33:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅希望我们和平相处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Imperator would see us to common ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.72,0:33:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可你我隔阂甚大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I find us far removed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.56,0:33:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,简直是云泥之别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As mortal from a god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.72,0:33:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一人面对一小撮叛贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One set upon a small band of rebels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.46,0:33:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有百人队的支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with support of a century,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.47,0:33:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,却丢盔弃甲 夺命而逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lost his sword, turned heel and fled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.56,0:33:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而另一人 孤身闯虎穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}While the other, strolled into the jaws of the beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.89,0:33:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,手无寸铁 仅凭如簧巧舌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absent weapon, and brought down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.36,0:33:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,拿下了一座城池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an entire city with but cunning and silver tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.96,0:33:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,想想吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Refresh mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.20,0:33:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你是哪一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which do you stand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.36,0:33:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,终有一日 我能官复原职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Upon a day my title shall be returned to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.20,0:33:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,把你踩在脚下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And place you beneath heel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.35,0:33:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我耽误你太久了 你还有要务在身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have delayed you too long from pressing charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.84,0:33:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你做的这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the opportunity it brings,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.26,0:33:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,多少能赢得一点点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to earn small sum of respect{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.50,0:34:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这些小兵的尊重呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from those of us that stand as soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.59,0:34:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 提比略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, and Tiberius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.84,0:34:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了牡蛎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oysters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.46,0:34:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,街上防守严密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The streets stand too swollen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.77,0:34:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只在屋顶上行动是没法出城的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And rooftops alone will not carry us free of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.12,0:34:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.77,0:34:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Halt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.41,0:34:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Part way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.74,0:34:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那叛徒还没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The traitor yet lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.37,0:34:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的行动受你们统帅的保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I move beneath protection of your Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.41,0:34:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你的船不在这个方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your ship stands in opposing direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.58,0:34:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要向刚收到的宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would present precious bounty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.76,0:34:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,表达一下喜爱之情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with offering of affection,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.13,0:34:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再回海上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before taking to unforgiving sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.26,0:34:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,放他们过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let them pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.76,0:35:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你看我就像看怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You look upon me as a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.42,0:35:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得我配不上你是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet am I not more desirable fate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.60,0:35:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可你丈夫死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With husband fallen to the afterlife,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.19,0:35:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着罗马人 你又能过上怎样的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what life would you have among the Romans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.47,0:35:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.14,0:35:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对他们来说跟奴隶差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No better than a slave to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.23,0:35:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是很看重你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bestow loftier consideration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.47,0:35:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会像克拉苏那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would never bargain you off,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.02,0:35:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,把你卖掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as Crassus has done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.72,0:35:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会把你关在笼子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor would I lock you in a cage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.52,0:35:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们轮流玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and pass you about,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.71,0:35:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我手下希望我这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as my men would have me do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.59,0:35:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.46,0:35:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你会站在我身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you shall stand beside me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.40,0:35:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,成为海上的王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a queen upon the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.73,0:35:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我最贵重的珍宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My greatest treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.90,0:35:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,见到我们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And all who cross our path{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.18,0:35:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,都会知道你属于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shall know that you are mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.21,0:36:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.36,0:36:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Heracleo, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.05,0:36:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉要让你吃点苦头 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies for the pain I cause, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.66,0:36:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.02,0:36:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,以后都不会这么痛苦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is the worst if it my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.14,0:36:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not believe it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.48,0:37:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看你还活着 真令人振奋 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It lifts spirits to see you alive,my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.09,0:37:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我的很多兄弟就没这个运气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many of my brothers did not fare as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.23,0:37:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不可避免的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An act born of necessity,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.40,0:37:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很难过啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and raised with heavy heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.11,0:37:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我很欣赏斯巴达克斯大王和他的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I much liked King Spartacus and his companions...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.71,0:37:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, most of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.92,0:37:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可我面临一个选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I was given a choice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.63,0:37:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是荣华富贵还是凄惨死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}between a wealthy life, or die a merciless death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.11,0:37:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,像我这种人 这根本没得选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which to a man of my sort, is no choice at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.72,0:37:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你怎么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know what thoughts pass through mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.94,0:37:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都是该死的西利西亚人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That we are but shit-eating Cilicians,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.09,0:37:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哪能跟竞技场之神相提并论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no match for a god of the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.82,0:37:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,也许不假 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps this is true, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.78,0:37:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我死之前 我的剑会割开你女人的喉咙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps my sword will find your woman's throat, before I fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.95,0:37:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,眼下这种状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing you must appreciate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.09,0:37:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你要理解我才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in such a delicate situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.36,0:37:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她不是我的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is not my woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.68,0:38:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,希贝儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sibyl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.87,0:38:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,看来这小丫头对你很重要嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you do care for the little one, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.81,0:38:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不过很遗憾 你害死她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it's a pity now that you have killed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.01,0:38:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.68,0:38:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.37,0:38:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快走 免得被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must move quickly before we are discovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.29,0:39:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,莱塔呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of Laeta?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.26,0:39:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.46,0:39:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能丢下她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We cannot leave her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.25,0:39:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她是罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She stands Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.79,0:39:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让人看到她和我们一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She won't be seen with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.82,0:39:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在只是奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand nothing but a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.63,0:39:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你们过去一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you once did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.06,0:40:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你鼓舞士气可真有一套 克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are truly gifted at motivating your men, Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.19,0:40:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是伟大领袖的特质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As all great leaders must be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.91,0:40:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这话别传到元老院去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not allow the Senate to hear you describe me as such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.23,0:40:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也许会把你五马分尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They might well tear you asunder in like fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.73,0:40:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give no worry to such thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.93,0:40:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你击退了斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shall gain their gratitude{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.53,0:40:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们必定很感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in blow struck against Spartacus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.55,0:40:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你还让希留爱沙山的市民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and return of Sinuessa en Valle to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.57,0:40:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,又回到了他们的家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}rightful embrace of its citizens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.08,0:40:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这才刚开始呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've just begun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.07,0:40:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我要更正你的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, but I must serve correction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.77,0:40:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这座美丽城市的市民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The citizens of this fair city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.42,0:40:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,全都惨死于暴怒的叛贼之手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were all laid to grass by rebellion's fury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.20,0:40:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,并非全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.02,0:40:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,所有贵族都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.16,0:40:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,市政官的妻子呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of the Aedile's wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.98,0:40:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她走了 永远不会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has left these walls, never to return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.86,0:41:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,莫非你要占有这座城吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would claim entire fucking city for yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.57,0:41:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,聪明人打仗不只是为了荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A wise man does not fight for glory alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.32,0:41:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,元老院绝不会轻易答应如此贪婪的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Senate will not easily swallow bitter news of such greed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.78,0:41:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,贪婪无非是嫉妒之人对雄心壮志的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Greed is but a word jealous men inflict upon the ambitious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.23,0:41:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只能任其自然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will be made to see past it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.17,0:41:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,将这一战利品赐给我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and oblige us in the spoils of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.78,0:41:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.15,0:41:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然要与你共享了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would share in good fortune, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.32,0:41:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你愿意得到现在住的宅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps the villa you now occupy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.35,0:41:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还有港口的一部分税收\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and a portion of the taxes levied upon port?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.05,0:41:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有人能说服元老院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If the Senate could be persuaded that we are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.56,0:41:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,答应我们的正当要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}deserving of such bold claim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.70,0:41:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们完成了不可能的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have done the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.33,0:41:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,当然值得奖励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely we should be rewarded for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.58,0:42:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一份血之献礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us have final tribute of blood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.84,0:42:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,向盖乌斯•尤利乌斯•恺撒致敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in honor of Gaius Julius Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.17,0:42:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.54,0:42:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.15,0:42:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的罗马懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roman fucking cowards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.99,0:42:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要是拿着剑来一场公平决斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shit running your leg in thought of giving sword{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.08,0:42:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就屁滚尿流了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and proper contest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.44,0:42:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有这样的机会 你会怎么做 野蛮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what would you do if graced with such opportunity, savage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.36,0:42:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,受到这样的待遇 我万分感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such spectacle is deeply appreciated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.88,0:42:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要是斯巴达克斯伏法那就更妙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet the fall of Spartacus greeted more so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.16,0:43:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,屠杀大戏要结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carnificina comes to an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.77,0:43:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就轮到叛贼头子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rebel king to soon follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.14,0:43:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.56,0:43:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,贵宾们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Honored guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.12,0:43:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我们齐聚此处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We come this day to praise a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.31,0:43:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,称颂一位出类拔萃的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}considered above all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.20,0:43:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定有诸神的庇佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man possessed of such good fortune{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.19,0:43:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,否则怎能有如此好的运气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he must indeed be blessed by the gods themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.86,0:43:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,屠杀战俘有个传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In storied tradition of Carnificina,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.57,0:43:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一杀代表了胜利之巅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the ultimate kill signifies pinnacle of victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.92,0:43:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是否应当把最后一击的荣耀交给恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall we award Caesar the privilege of delivering fated blow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.46,0:43:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,让他使用打仗所用的利剑 而不是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with sword of steel in a war he began with but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.58,0:43:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,如簧巧舌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}tongue of silver?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.96,0:43:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒 恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar! Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.65,0:44:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你的发言真是深思熟虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You choose your words with care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.27,0:44:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,无论谁身在此位 都应当如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As all who must, in such position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.04,0:44:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人的死 不是恺撒的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This man shall fall not in honor of Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.37,0:44:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是伟大的克拉苏家族的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor the great House of Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.87,0:44:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他的死 是伟大罗马的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He shall fall in honor of the glory of Rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.18,0:44:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glory of Rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.48,0:45:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.06,0:45:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.90,0:45:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是神的旨意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is the will of the gods,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.29,0:45:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神要这头野兽挣脱镣铐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that this beast shall see himself free of shackles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.29,0:45:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,让我得以证明我实至名归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that I may prove myself worthy of the praise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.61,0:45:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不负我们的统帅 以及…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bestowed upon me by our Imperator...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.97,0:45:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他儿子的好意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.15,0:45:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那就来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.91,0:45:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们看看你们叛贼有什么本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see what challenge your rebellion truly offers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.41,0:46:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在庆祝吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They hold celebration?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.76,0:46:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,处决你们当中还幸存的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Executions, for those among you yet of this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.91,0:46:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天 我要让他们血债血偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will have blood in their name, upon a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.16,0:46:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,照我说的 尽量走小巷或人少的街道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay to the alleys and lesser streets as I guide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.28,0:46:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你才有可能活到那一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And perhaps live to see it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.16,0:47:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如果叛贼都像此人这么厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If this man stands for all of the rebellion,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.05,0:47:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们可能庆祝得太早了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}celebration may hold premature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.14,0:47:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人的死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let this man's death serve as{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.05,0:48:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是斯巴达克斯本人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}harbinger for the fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.88,0:48:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,即将遭受同样下场的先兆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we shall inflict upon Spartacus himself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.89,0:48:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,打得好 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well fought, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.42,0:48:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,吃屎去吧 罗马狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Swallow cock, you Roman shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.68,0:48:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Behold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.36,0:48:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们最伟大的战士也因惧怕恺撒而自杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their greatest warriors take their own lives in fear of Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.45,0:48:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.55,0:49:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们出不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will not make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.89,0:49:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你会骑马吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you ride?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.61,0:49:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我骑过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've seen it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.26,0:49:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.08,0:49:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会回来救你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will not turn back for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.12,0:49:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.39,0:49:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥不是只要一个女人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought Heracleo granted but one woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.92,0:49:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,另外这个哪儿来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where did he come by this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.86,0:50:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.63,0:50:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,去敲警钟 一帮废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sound the alarm, you worthless shits!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.46,0:50:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Close gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.69,0:50:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,叛贼逃跑了 守住城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rebel escapes! Man the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.12,0:52:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我们的军队不追击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do we not move after him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.51,0:52:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,非得让我恺撒冒生命危险亲手杀死每个叛贼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Must Julius fucking Caesar risk life to kill every last Rebel himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.18,0:52:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,夜晚上山 对我军不利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To attempt the ridge at night would see us to disadvantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.69,0:52:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,到了早上 他就和斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And by morning he will be to the wind with Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.31,0:52:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你放走的那帮叛贼会合了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the rest of his rebel horde you allowed to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.21,0:52:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是放他们走 是给了他们虚无的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have allowed nothing but the illusion of hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.88,0:52:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,日升之时 我军将在十一抽杀律的威胁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When sun breaks my legions shall begin final march,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.84,0:52:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,开始全面围剿叛贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}spurred by dread of decimation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.53,0:52:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们渴望得到你昨晚所拥有的那种荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and dreams of glory sparked by celebration in your honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.05,0:52:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯不是傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus is no fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.38,0:52:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他会在大风雪中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You expect him to wait in driven snow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.78,0:52:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等你到来 给他致命一击吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for you to arrive and announce his end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.87,0:52:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那正是我所期待的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is exactly what I expect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.38,0:53:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We cannot remain here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.62,0:53:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那你想怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would you have us do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.96,0:53:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,长出翅膀 飞到太阳神阿波罗那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sprout wings and soar towards warming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.74,0:53:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,投向他温暖的怀抱吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}embrace of fucking Apollo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.02,0:53:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该回去 夺回希留爱沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should turn and retake Sinuessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.15,0:53:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那座城已经陷落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The city is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.94,0:53:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我们不行动 我们也完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As we shall be, if we do not act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.36,0:53:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.91,0:53:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为就我命硬呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I believed myself a difficult man to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.71,0:54:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.97,0:54:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我们带来了俘虏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You bring us a prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.19,0:54:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,莱塔现在跟你我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Laeta now stands as you or I,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.16,0:54:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,被共和国踩在脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}beneath heel of Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.67,0:54:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好好照顾的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She may yet live,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.14,0:54:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,她也许能活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if her wounds are tended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.86,0:54:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,救活她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.27,0:54:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,卢戈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lugo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.44,0:54:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这些人都还活着 真是奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is miracle any of us before you yet draw breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.81,0:54:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神肯定听到了我们的祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods themselves must have taken note of delivered prayer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.26,0:54:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,改变了我们的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in order to see us from certain end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.43,0:54:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕只是时间问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear they have but delayed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.31,0:55:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is such a thing possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.77,0:55:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对共和国最富有的人来说 没什么不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing is beyond reach for the richest man in the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.65,0:55:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.81,0:55:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直想把我们困在山上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was always his intention, to trap us upon this ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.99,0:55:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他必定率军出城向我们后方进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will march from the city with his armies behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.31,0:55:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等他到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And when he comes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.78,0:55:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡也随之降临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}death shall follow in his wake.{\r}
